Inclusion Criteria:

          -  Male and female patients between the ages of 18 and 65;

          -  Between 5'4" and 6'2"

          -  Body Mass Index<32

          -  Willing and able to provide written informed consent;

          -  Understands the clinical study requirements and is able to comply with the follow-up
             schedule set forth in the protocol;

          -  Clinically diagnosed with gastroesophageal reflux disease with extra-esophageal
             symptoms (i.e. chronic cough, choking, aspiration, chronic post nasal drip, globus,
